# Catalog requests (Step 12). Start the AppHost, sign in with identity.http, and paste the access token here.
# Don't commit a real token: the repository is public.

@catalog = https://localhost:7160
@token = paste-the-access-token-here

### No token: 401
GET {{catalog}}/whoami

### Who am I, according to the token alone
GET {{catalog}}/whoami
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Not marked public, so even an unknown address is 401 without a token
GET {{catalog}}/no-such-page

### Readiness needs no token
GET {{catalog}}/health
